### 📁 Refactor Structure

#### 1. `FileSystem.js` (Abstract Base Class)
Defines the interface:

```js
export class FileSystem {
  async list(path) {
    throw new Error('list() not implemented');
  }

  async goUp() {
    throw new Error('goUp() not implemented');
